Project Title 

Employee Performance & Workforce Insights Dashboard – Power BI

Description :

This project presents a Power BI dashboard designed to analyze employee performance, training effectiveness, 
and workforce productivity.

The dashboard helps HR teams:

-Identify high-performing departments
-Evaluate training outcomes across experience levels
-Analyze recruitment channel effectiveness
-Monitor KPI achievement and recognition trends

📌 Tools Used

-Power BI
-DAX for calculated measures
-Data cleaning and transformation
-Google Sheet 

📌 Key Insights

-Performance distribution varies across departments
-Training outcomes remain consistent across experience levels
-Recruitment sources influence workforce quality (Reference , Other , Source )
-KPI achievement trends highlight productive teams

📌 Business Value

The dashboard enables HR decision-makers to improve employee development strategies, 
optimize hiring sources, and strengthen performance management frameworks.
